# hachimaki-dev — Cline / Roo Code Rules

## Project
Personal website: React 18 + Vite + CSS native + Supabase.
Single admin user. Landing + Blog + Portfolio + Admin panel.
Deploy: GitHub Pages.

## Strict Constraints
- JS only (no TS)
- CSS vars from `src/styles/tokens.css` only — no hardcoded values
- No CSS frameworks
- Supabase client from `src/lib/supabase.js` only — singleton
- No localStorage for data
- Loading + error + empty states always
- Toast notifications via `useToast()`
- Migrations in `migrations/NNN.sql` — gitignored

## Key Files
- `src/styles/tokens.css` — Design tokens (colors, fonts, spacing)
- `src/lib/supabase.js` — Supabase singleton
- `src/lib/constants.js` — Routes, tables, config
- `src/router.jsx` — All routes with lazy loading
- `src/features/auth/AuthGuard.jsx` — Protects /admin/*

## Naming
- Components: PascalCase (`BlogCard.jsx`)
- Hooks: `use` prefix (`useBlogPosts.js`)
- CSS: kebab-case (`.blog-card__title`)
- Variables: `--color-accent`, `--space-4`, `--font-sans`

## Tables: profiles, blog_posts, projects, rooms, room_members, stream_state, signaling_messages, recordings, chat_messages, photos, visitor_logs, contact_messages, subscriptions, stream_transcriptions, friend_links
## RLS: public read if published=true, auth write. Streaming: open signaling/chat, auth for rooms/recordings/transcriptions. Contact & Subscriptions: public insert, auth read/write. Friend Links: public read, auth all.


## UI / UX Guidelines (Retro VHS / Surveillance System)

1. **Aesthetic Identity**: The public-facing site follows a Retro VHS / Surveillance / Cyberpunk aesthetic.
2. **Key Elements**:
   - **Monospace Fonts**: Use var(--font-mono) for metadata, badges, system logs, dates, and IDs.
   - **Sans-serif Fonts**: Use var(--font-sans) for primary titles and heavy readable text.
   - **Terminal Language**: Use technical/system terms in uppercase (e.g., TRANSMISIONES, SEÑAL ACTIVA, DECODIFICANDO, ERROR DE TRANSMISIÓN).
   - **Badges & Glows**: Active or primary states should use the var(--color-accent) with subtle glows (box-shadow).
   - **Scanlines & Noise**: Use .vhs-scanlines.vhs-noise backgrounds for the main page wrappers.
   - **Feed Items (Cards)**: Use blog-feed-item or .outsider__feed-item style (border-left accent, dashed inner shadows, terminal header).
   - **Colors**: Rely exclusively on src/styles/tokens.css. Primary accent is --color-accent (#c8f000).
3. **Animations**: Use micro-animations like animate-slide-up for loading content, glow-pulse for status dots, and image scaling on hover.
   4. **Icons**: Use `pixelarticons` exclusively via the `<Icon name="..." />` component (from `src/components/ui/Icon.jsx`). Do not use inline SVGs.
\n## 🔄 Auto-Maintenance (MANDATORY)
After every architectural change (new/removed components, pages, hooks, routes, tables, tokens, deps), update ALL agent config files: `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `GEMINI.md`, `.cursorrules`, `.windsurfrules`, `.clinerules`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`. Do it automatically, no permission needed.
